# rustacs - WebRCON command-line tool for the (RustDedicated) WebSocket interface
#
# Unlike other games, the Rust game server binary (RustDedicated) does not
# listen to standard input (stdin) when running on Linux. rustacs passes
# commands to RustDedicated through its WebRCON WebSocket interface.
#
# RUSTACS configuration is read from:
#
#   /home/rust/.rustacs/.rustserver.env
#
# The dot-env is authoritative for RUSTACS paths and settings.
#
### SETUP:
#
#   mkdir -p /home/rust/bin
#   cp rustacs /home/rust/bin/rustacs
#   chmod 770 /home/rust/bin/rustacs
#   ln -s /home/rust/bin/rustacs /usr/local/bin/rustacs
#
# Python dependency:
#
#   sudo apt install python3-websockets
#
### USAGE:
#
#   rustacs status
#   rustacs serverinfo
#   rustacs say "Hello World!"
#   rustacs server.save
#   rustacs server start
#   rustacs server stop
#   rustacs server restart
#   rustacs server status
